<title>USA: TCSI Corp names Ram Banin president.</title>
<headline>TCSI Corp names Ram Banin president.</headline>
<dateline>BERKELEY, Calif. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCSI Corp said it has named Ram Banin as president and chief operating officer and said Roger Strauch will continue as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Banin has been with TCSI for over four years as executive vice president and general manager of TCSI's Object Software Group, the division that has led TCSI's growth in recent years.</p>
